# OpenWiki Instructions for __PROJECT_NAME__

Generate repository documentation under `openwiki/` only.

- Treat `.okf/` as read-only curated project context.
- Do not create, modify, delete, rename, or migrate files under `.okf/`.
- Preserve all content outside OpenWiki marker blocks in `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md`.
- Do not include secrets, credentials, private keys, `.env` values, or local machine paths.
- Cite source files with repository-relative paths.
- Label uncertainty and generated interpretation clearly.
- Keep generated wiki claims separate from accepted OKF requirements and decisions.
